An '''Ashfang Follower''' is a [[Mob]] that spawns while fighting {{MobSprite|Ashfang}} in the {{Zone|Ruins of Ashfang}} in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}. 

== Spawning ==
{{Main|Ashfang}}
Four '''Ashfang Followers''' spawn during {{MobSprite|Ashfang}}'s "[[#Ashfang#Summons Phase|Summons Phase]]". The phase initially occurs when Ashfang is first attacked, as well as repeatedly throughout the fight, each time lasting {{Green|50}} seconds.

== Behavior ==
'''Ashfang Followers''' can only be killed by entering a [[File:Rekindled Ember Fragment (v1).png|21px|link=]] {{Red|Gravity Orb}} when following the player, three of which spawn from {{MobSprite|Ashfang}} during a 3 second period during the fight. They use various attack methods against nearby players, including the following:
* [[File:Barrier.png|21px|link=]] {{red|Cryogenic Blast}}: Shot while following a player, dealing {{stat|Damage|2,000}} on impact, disabling abilities and slowing them down for {{green|5}} seconds. 
* [[File:Fire Charge.png|21px|link=]] {{red|Fireball}}: Shoots one fireball at the player every {{Green|2}} seconds, dealing {{stat|Damage|1,000}} on impact.
* They will repeatedly follower the player. This can be somewhat mitigated with {{Item|Gyrokinetic Wand}}, making them more manageable.

After the {{Green|50}} seconds of the [[#Ashfang#Summons Phase|Summons Phase]] are up, each {{MobSprite|Ashfang}} summon will be re-absorbed, healing Ashfang for {{Stat|Health|250,000}} per summon.

