Upon killing an '''Ashfang Follower''', {{MobSprite|Ashfang Underling}}, or {{MobSprite|Ashfang Acolyte}}, a [[File:Burning Eye (v1).png|21px|link=]]{{orange|Blazing Soul}} will spawn at its death location, which despawns after {{green|10}} seconds. Punching one launches it in the direction the player is facing. If it hits {{MobSprite|Ashfang}}, it deals a static {{si|dmg|2,000,000}}.

